107.000793 DEBUG baro: alt=1624.4...m gain=0.0m loss=0.0m
156.000793 DEBUG baro: alt=1667.3873m gain=0.0m loss=0.0m
157.000793 DEBUG baro: alt=1667.8455m gain=0.0m loss=0.0m
